'''Battle in the Bath''' (バトル銭湯, ''Batoru Sentō'', '''Battle Bathhouse''') is the 17th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 66th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter features [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]s combined with other traits in most of its levels. It is very diverse, but it shouldn't cause any trouble except for [[Steamworks Ltd.|Stage 1]]. It should also be noted that stage 5 is essentially a remake of [[Low Tide Beach]] as well, so don’t take your time there.
{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2's [[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]] enemies to [[Legend Stages]] alongside one new [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy:
*[[Zuche]]: A fast-moving [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemy with one burrow. He has low health and very high DPS, making him a low-ranged glass cannon.
*[[The Thrillerz]]: A Zombie peon that can burrow twice. The first of their kind, they are very annoying when they intercept your meatshields but aren't as annoying if dealt with properly.
*[[Mr. Puffington]]: A pufferfish that functions similarly to [[Brollow]], but with much more health and knockbacks, along with attacks that extend past his very low attack range.

